title: "MCP resource-exhaustion measurement harness and experiment results"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible loopback experiments for seven Model Context Protocol (MCP)
  resource-exhaustion vectors against the official Python and TypeScript SDKs,
  including replicated smoke tests and a practical high-concurrency flood
  with a concurrent benign client.
